l},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5344194435","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/122598#issuecomment-5344194435","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/122598","id":5344194435,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABPonvgw","user":{"login":"og-mrk","id":70659536,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjcwNjU5NTM2","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/70659536?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/og-mrk","html_url":"https://github.com/og-mrk","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/og-mrk/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/og-mrk/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/og-mrk/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/og-mrk/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/og-mrk/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/og-mrk/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/og-mrk/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/og-mrk/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/og-mrk/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-08-19T15:19:31Z","updated_at":"2026-08-19T15:19:31Z","body":"> Please note that we do not accept feature PRs by new contributors [see here](https://contributing.godotengine.org/en/latest/pull_requests/pull_request_guidelines.html#no-features-from-new-contributors)\r\n> \r\n> This is a pretty complex and involved feature with many areas touched so this doesn't feel appropriate for a new contributor IMO\r\n\r\nCompletely understandable, I'm still learning more about the Engine, and will continue developing this PR/finalizing it if it's OK by the core team, if not (maybe this whole approach isn't ideal), feel free to inform me so I can close this PR.\r\n\r\nPlease note that I've tried my best to know what each change does, and if I did anything silly, please point it out so I can learn from my mistakes. ","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5344194435/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5344432539","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/122598#issuecomment-5344432539","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/122598","id":5344432539,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABPo2Rmw","user":{"login":"AThousandShips","id":96648715,"node_id":"U_kgDOBcK-Cw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/96648715?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips","html_url":"https://github.com/AThousandShips","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-08-19T15:38:56Z","updated_at":"2026-08-19T15:38:56Z","body":"One area that is missing currently is the GDExtension side","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5344432539/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5360400297","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/122598#issuecomment-5360400297","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/122598","id":5360400297,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABP4E3qQ","user":{"login":"Ferinzz","id":44227010,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ0MjI3MDEw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/44227010?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ferinzz","html_url":"https://github.com/Ferinzz","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ferinzz/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ferinzz/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ferinzz/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ferinzz/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ferinzz/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ferinzz/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ferinzz/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ferinzz/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ferinzz/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-08-20T19:00:41Z","updated_at":"2026-08-20T19:00:41Z","body":"> One area that is missing currently is the GDExtension side\r\n\r\nThis kind of information isn't currently required or available for custom callables in GDE, unless the library stores it in their own version of methodbind.\r\nThe CustomCallableInfo struct would need to be extended to include a new function pointer to a get_arguments function from the GDE implementation. Ideally we could pass a vector of propertyInfo, which the Godot implementation converts to the array of dictionaries.\r\nOr the callable creation function could have a new version which will accept a new CallableMethodInfo struct.\r\n\r\nI believe most libraries are storing the callable's function information on their end, doing their own type compares during the call. Which could make the first option more appealing.","author_association":"NONE","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5360400297/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5360418130","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/122598#issuecomment-5360418130","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/122598","id":5360418130,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABP4F9Ug","user":{"login":"AThousandShips","id":96648715,"node_id":"U_kgDOBcK-Cw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/96648715?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips","html_url":"https://github.com/AThousandShips","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-08-20T19:02:24Z","updated_at":"2026-08-20T19:02:24Z","body":"The point being that there's no interface exposed in this to provide information from an extension","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5360418130/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5631125471","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/122598#issuecomment-5631125471","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/122598","id":5631125471,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABT6Qn3w","user":{"login":"Ivorforce","id":2308167,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIzMDgxNjc=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/2308167?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce","html_url":"https://github.com/Ivorforce","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-09-11T07:40:55Z","updated_at":"2026-09-11T07:43:55Z","body":"Hello, as a core maintainer, I would consider this PR to be too substantial to be worked on by a new contributor.\r\nYou have 3 merged PRs so our definition does not consider you to be one anymore. That's why i'm not closing your PR.\r\n\r\nStill, I would recommend you continue to work on smaller PRs, especially within core, before you start diving into refactors that tackle many critical core classes like in this PR.\r\n\r\nThe two proposals you have linked appear to be undermotivated for the size of this change. The maintainers have discussed this and see a possible connection to [github.com/godotengine/godot-proposals/issues/2557](https://github.com/godotengine/godot-proposals/issues/2557) and [github.com/godotengine/godot-proposals/issues/10807](https://github.com/godotengine/godot-proposals/issues/10807), which would be a better motivation, but there is no consensus yet on how implement those. So this PR will probably not be reviewed until there is.\r\n\r\n(P.S. since you still seem to be actively working on the PR i put it into draft)","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5631125471/reactions","total_count":2,"+1":2,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5637750746","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/122598#issuecomment-5637750746","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/122598","id":5637750746,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABUAk_2g","user":{"login":"og-mrk","id":70659536,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjcwNjU5NTM2","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/70659536?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/og-mrk","html_url":"https://github.com/og-mrk","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/og-mrk/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/og-mrk/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/og-mrk/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/og-mrk/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/og-mrk/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/og-mrk/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/og-mrk/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/og-mrk/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/og-mrk/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-09-11T16:49:59Z","updated_at":"2026-09-11T16:51:18Z","body":"> Still, I would recommend you continue to work on smaller PRs, especially within core, before you start diving into refactors that tackle many critical core classes like in this PR.\r\n\r\nUnderstandable, and I didn't know this change would balloon this much when I started (as I wasn't familiar with Core), but I learned a lot and now have ways to tell (in advance) if a change takes a lot of effort or not. Will look into other proposals in the future requiring smaller changes.\r\n\r\n> The two proposals you have linked appear to be undermotivated for the size of this change.\r\n\r\nAlthough this addition is a lot and might benefit some users, I think for some cases (GDScript lambdas specifically) there isn't a viable workaround to tell what the method looks like at runtime (i.e. no reflection available).\r\n\r\n> The maintainers have discussed this and see a possible connection to https://github.com/godotengine/godot-proposals/issues/2557 and https://github.com/godotengine/godot-proposals/issues/10807, which would be a better motivation, but there is no consensus yet on how implement those. So this PR will probably not be reviewed until there is.\r\n\r\nLooked into those and generally they're better approaches to Callable-Signal validation, but I think it'll require a lot of changes as well, a somewhat older PR tries to solve [Signal param type hint](https://github.com/godotengine/godot-proposals/issues/2557) ([link to PR](https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/71952)), unfortunately it's outdated and looks stall (from what I can tell).\r\n\r\n**EDIT**: Also will double check if everything is good before marking PR as ready 😅","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5637750746/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5855633432","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/122598#issuecomment-5855633432","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/122598","id":5855633432,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABXQXgGA","user":{"login":"Ivorforce","id":2308167,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIzMDgxNjc=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/2308167?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce","html_url":"https://github.com/Ivorforce","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-09-27T12:00:51Z","updated_at":"2026-09-27T12:00:51Z","body":"Hello @og-mrk, every time you push, I get a notification, and the Godot builds are being triggered, which can be several hours of active CPU work.\r\n\r\nIf you're still working on this PR, please either work in a separate branch or wait to push, until you're done with your work.","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5855633432/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null}